    "body": "## Summary by Sourcery\n\nIntroduce a unified, canonical instruction framework for AI coding agents contributing to this repository.\n\nDocumentation:\n- Document project-wide AI agent policies, architecture rules, and verified commands in a new canonical agents.md file.\n\nChores:\n- Add adapter instruction files for Copilot, Claude, and Codex that defer to the central agents.md policy and scoped instruction files.",
