    "body": "This document outlines the code review protocol for AI agents reviewing code in the Eventyay repository, including architecture checks, file-scoped standards, security validation, and feedback guidelines.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"971\" height=\"578\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-17 at 5 17 16\u202fPM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7360dc56-4607-4e9b-a30b-8409c90f4155\" />\n\n## Summary by Sourcery\n\nDocumentation:\n- Add SKILL.md under .github/skills/code-review defining canonical code review procedures and rules for AI-based reviewers, aligned with existing AGENTS and instructions files.",
