    "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\nThis PR introduces a repository-aware AI context system for VoxBento.\r\n\r\nThe goal is to make the codebase easier to understand, navigate, review, and modify for both human contributors and AI coding agents by generating implementation-derived documentation and workflow guidance.\r\n\r\nNo application behavior is changed.\r\n\r\n## What was added\r\n\r\n### Agent Context\r\n\r\nAdded `.github/.agents/context/` containing:\r\n\r\n* `REPOSITORY_CONTEXT.md`\r\n* `ROUTE_MAP.md`\r\n* `DATABASE_MAP.md`\r\n* `TRANSCRIPTION_MAP.md`\r\n* `CHANGE_IMPACT_MAP.md`\r\n* `AI_WORKFLOWS.md`\r\n* `TECHNICAL_DEBT_REPORT.md`\r\n\r\nThese documents provide a structured view of:\r\n\r\n* system architecture\r\n* route ownership\r\n* database relationships\r\n* transcription pipeline\r\n* component responsibilities\r\n* common development workflows\r\n* change impact analysis\r\n* known technical debt\r\n\r\n### Repository-Specific Skills\r\n\r\nAdded `.github/.agents/skills/` to provide reusable engineering playbooks for:\r\n\r\n* architecture review\r\n* route analysis\r\n* database analysis\r\n* deployment review\r\n* security review\r\n* incident investigation\r\n* production readiness\r\n* test generation\r\n* repository navigation\r\n\r\nThese skills are tailored to VoxBento's actual architecture rather than generic templates.\r\n\r\n## Why\r\n\r\nAs VoxBento grows, contributors and coding agents spend increasing amounts of time rediscovering architecture, request flows, database relationships, and transcription subsystem behavior.\r\n\r\nThis change creates a centralized knowledge layer that:\r\n\r\n* reduces onboarding time\r\n* improves PR review quality\r\n* improves architectural consistency\r\n* reduces accidental regressions\r\n* improves AI-assisted development workflows\r\n\r\n## Scope\r\n\r\nThis PR is documentation and workflow infrastructure only.\r\n\r\nThere are:\r\n\r\n* no runtime changes\r\n* no API changes\r\n* no database changes\r\n* no deployment changes\r\n* no user-facing changes\r\n\r\n## Follow-up Work\r\n\r\nFuture improvements may include:\r\n\r\n* automated context regeneration\r\n* route-to-model ownership mapping\r\n* repository index generation\r\n* expanded PR review workflows\r\n* architecture drift detection\r\n* documentation freshness validation\r\n",
